    "Condition : 1 - On the 17 November 2025, the use of the property at Second Floor Flat, Thames Works, Church Street as supported housing was lawful because:\n\nThe use as supported housing would fall under Use Class C3(b) and not alter the overall use of the property as a single residential dwelling where people live as one household. Therefore, the proposal would not constitute development as per the meaning of development within Section 55 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended)."
